<div class="workspace"><aside class="side"><div class="section-label mb-2">Site intelligence</div><h4 class="mb-3">Survey workspace</h4><div class="metric" id="area">0.00 m²</div><div class="muted">Live polygon area</div><div class="mt-3 metric" id="perimeter">0.00 m</div><div class="muted">Perimeter</div><div class="mt-4 section-label">Survey points</div><table class="table-mini mt-2"><tbody id="points"><tr><td class="muted">Click Draw plot, then click the map.</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="mt-4 section-label">Technology</div><div class="feature"><strong>TypeScript / JavaScript</strong><span class="muted">Interactive browser map and CAD-style controls.</span></div><div class="feature"><strong>Python</strong><span class="muted">Target layer for GIS, AI and geometry services.</span></div><div class="feature"><strong>PostgreSQL + PostGIS</strong><span class="muted">Target spatial database for parcels, roads and buildings.</span></div><div class="feature"><strong>C++ / WebGPU</strong><span class="muted">Future high-performance 3D geometry and rendering layer.</span></div></aside>
